    "chunk_text": "dd gyldenra hringa his sige to tacne. Be \u00fe\u00e6m hringum mon mehte witan hw\u00e6t Romana dugu\u00f0e gefeallen w\u00e6s, for \u00feon \u00fee hit w\u00e6s \u00c6fter \u00fe\u00e6m gefeohte w\u00e6ron Romane swa swi\u00f0e for\u00feohte, \u00fe\u00e6tte Celius Metellus, \u00fee \u00fea heora & hie \u00fe\u00e6t swa gel\u00e6sten, gif him Scipia ne gestirde, se w\u00e6s \u00feara cempena ieldest, mid \u00fe\u00e6m \u00fe\u00e6t & he hie ealle mid \u00fe\u00e6m geniedde \u00fe\u00e6t hie a\u00feas sworan \u00fe\u00e6t hie ealle \u00e6tg\u00e6dere wolden, o\u00fe\u00fee on \u00c6fter \u00f0\u00e6m hie gesetton tictator, \u00fe\u00e6t he sceolde bion hierra ofer \u00fea consulas, se w\u00e6s haten Decius He n\u00e6s buton seofontienewintre. & Scipian hie gesetton to consule. & ealle \u00fea men \u00fee hie on \u00f0eowdome h\u00e6fdon hie gefreodon, on \u00fe\u00e6t gerad \u00fe\u00e6t he him a\u00f0as sworan Ond sume, \u00fea \u00fee heora hlafordas freogean noldon, o\u00fe\u00fee hie ne anhagade \u00fe\u00e6t hie mehten, \u00feonne & ealle \u00fea \u00fee fordemede w\u00e6ron \u00e6r \u00fe\u00e6m o\u00fe\u00fee hie selfe forworht h\u00e6fdon, hie hit eall forgeafon wi\u00f0 \u00deara monna w\u00e6s siex M, \u00fea hie gegaderad w\u00e6ron. & ealle Italiam geswicon Romanum, & to Hannibale gecirdon, for \u00feon \u00fee hie w\u00e6ron orwene \u00dea gefor Hannibal on Benefente, & hie him ongean coman, & him to gecirdon. \u00c6fter \u00fe\u00e6m Romane h\u00e6fdon gegaderad feower legian heora",
